                <pb facs="1044" n="894" sameAs="frus:frus1907p2/pg894"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 2151/48.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Gummeré to
                        the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Tangier</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1907-08-23"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">August 23,
                    1907</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>States that the troops of the Sultan have been routed, with heavy losses, by
                    tribes under the leadership of Raisuli, and that the situation at Alcazar, only
                    two days from Tangier, is very serious.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
